  "description": "Enterprise-grade project, dependency and build management for x86-64 assembly, on MSBuild and NuGet. The SDK behind .asmproj projects: NASM sources built into Linux shared libraries, static libraries and executables with dotnet build, consumed through PackageReference and ProjectReference, and packed with dotnet pack. Ships with a bundled NASM + LLVM toolchain, so no assembler or linker needs to be installed.",
